# Phase 2A-5 ARCH-006: hardening-gate JSON reports are runtime
# artifacts produced by orchestrator/Run-WaggleHardeningGates.ps1
# every time gates are run. They are local-only by design --
# downstream phase final reports may QUOTE summaries from them but
# the raw JSON does not need to be committed.
#
# This .gitignore ignores all *.json (including the `latest.json`
# Copy-Item shortcut) but keeps the README.md and this .gitignore
# itself.
*.json
!README.md
!.gitignore
